  "description": "<span>⭐ Give access to any Race Across the World experience on Fever. Inspired by the award-winning TV show, these immersive adventures put teamwork, strategy, and navigation skills to the test. No maps, no set routes - just clues to follow, decisions to make, and a challenge to experience at your own pace. Let the gift recipeint choose the experience and take part whenever the time is right.</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n<span>📺 Dive into the official live experience of the hit TV show</span><br>\r\n<span>🌇 Six exciting cities to choose from</span><br>\r\n<span>🏙️ Explore the city’s iconic landmarks and hidden gems as you race across 3 legs</span><br>\r\n<span>☕ At each checkpoint take an optional break, with race-exclusive discounts available at partner venues</span><br>\r\n<span>🧩 Solve clues, overcome physical puzzles, and unlock surprises along the way</span><br>\r\n<span>💰 Manage your in-game budget wisely to access shortcuts and new routes&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<span>🏆 Your race, your choices — become the daily, weekly, or all-time champion!&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<span>👨‍👨‍👧‍👧 The perfect after-work or weekend activity with friends, family, and colleagues</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n<strong>London: The City</strong><br>\r\n<span>📍 Location: Liverpool St. Station</span><br>\r\n<span>📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector</span><br>\r\n<span>🕒 Opening hours:&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<span>- Monday–Saturday: 9 a.m. – 7:30 p.m. (last entry at 7:30 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>- Sunday: 9:30 a.m. – 4:30 p.m. (last entry at 4:30 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>⏳ Duration: 2-3 hours&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>London: West End&nbsp;</strong><br>\r\n<span>📍 Location: (Green Park Station)</span><br>\r\n<span>📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector</span><br>\r\n<span>🕒 Opening hours:&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<span>- Monday–Saturday: 10 a.m. – 8:00 p.m. (last entry at 8:00 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>- Sunday: 10:00 a.m. – 7:00 p.m. (last entry at 7:00 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>⏳ Duration: 2-3 hours&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Manchester</strong><br>\r\n<span>📍 Location: (Stevenson Square, Northern Quarter)</span><br>\r\n<span>📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector</span><br>\r\n<span>🕒 Opening hours:&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<span>- Monday–Wednesday: 11 a.m. – 7:30 p.m. (last entry at 7:30 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>- Thursday–Wednesday: 10 a.m. – 7:30 p.m. (last entry at 7:30 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>- Saturday–Wednesday: 9:30 a.m. – 7:30 p.m. (last entry at 7:30 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>⏳ Duration: 2-3 hours</span><br>\r\n<span>&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<strong>Bristol</strong><br>\r\n<span>📍 Location: Bristol (College Green)</span><br>\r\n<span>📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector</span><br>\r\n<span>🕒 Opening hours:&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<span>- Monday: 11:30 a.m. – 4:30 p.m. (last entry at 4:30 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>- Tuesday–Saturday: 8:00 a.m. – 6:30 p.m. (last entry at 6:30 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>- Sunday: 8:30 a.m. – 2:00 p.m. (last entry at 2:00 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>⏳ Duration: 2-3 hours&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>York</strong><br>\r\n<span>📍 Location: (The Shambles)</span><br>\r\n<span>📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector</span><br>\r\n<span>🕒 Opening hours:&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<span>- Sunday–Thursrday: 9 a.m. – 7:30 p.m. (last entry at 7:30 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>- Sunday: 10:00 a.m. – 7:00 p.m. (last entry at 7:00 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>⏳ Duration: 2-3 hours&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Edinburgh</strong><br>\r\n<span>📍 Location: (Shandwick Place)</span><br>\r\n<span>📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector</span><br>\r\n<span>🕒 Opening hours:&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<span>- Monday–Sunday: 10 a.m. – 8:00 p.m. (last entry at 8:00 p.m.)</span><br>\r\n<span>⏳ Duration: 2-3 hours&nbsp;</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span>👤 Age requirement: All ages are welcome, however, you must be 18 or older to purchase tickets, and an adult ticket must be purchased along with a Child ticket. Children under 10 enter for free.</span><br>\r\n<span>♿ Accessibility: the experience is step free</span><br>\r\n<span>👥 2-8 players per team:</span><em> </em><span>Make one booking for your teams, purchase your tickets together, to play together! Large groups can split into smaller teams (on the same or back to back time slots) and go head-to-head!</span><br>\r\n<span>📧</span><a href=\"https://citydays.com/raceacrosstheworld/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> </a><a href=\"https://citydays.com/raceacrosstheworld/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Set up your team here</a><span> within the 7 days prior to access the experience</span><br>\r\n<span>❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience</span><a href=\"https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/london/faqs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> </a><a href=\"https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/london/faqs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\n<span>You’ve seen it on TV, now it’s your turn to race! The</span><a href=\"https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> </a><a href=\"https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Race Across the World Experience</em></a><span> packs all the excitement of the hit TV show into a 2 to 3-hour private team adventure across one of six fantastic cities. The streets become your playground as you navigate your chosen city, solve escape room-style puzzles, and manage your budget in this high-stakes foot race. Just like the show, every route you take, decision you make, and virtual penny you spend affects your journey. At the end, your team’s score, based on time and remaining funds, will determine your spot on the live leaderboard. Do you have what it takes to be crowned the daily or weekly champions? There’s only one way to find out… Get your tickets today!</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span>Group bookings over 50+ people with bespoke requirements? The experience is suitable for large groups of any size, you can book direct on this page (choose your number of teams, you can span multiple time slots), or fill in the enquiry form here -</span><a href=\"https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/london/groups/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> </a><a href=\"https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/london/groups/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://raceacrosstheworldexperience.com/london/groups/</a>",
